    {
      "name": "shrubs_dry_tuft",
      "type": "groundcover",
      "comment": "Shrub placement. History: minimal caller 2026-10-12 rendered the CrossedQuads rows through the silica_grass Cross block; wiring pass B4 (2026-10-13) bound the engine's procgen plant textures into live worldgen -- each live CrossedQuads biome now places its OWN plant block per biome_vegetation.h's formula rows: DicingPlains -> procgen_formula_leaf (leaf lens), ResonatorSpires -> procgen_formula_blob (soft blob). The feature NAME is unchanged on purpose: it feeds the placement seed, and the two entries' biome maps partition the old single entry's map, so placement positions/densities are identical to the silica_grass era (0.012 / 0.020) -- only the placed block (and thus the rendered texture) changed. Modeled3D shrubs (TraceForest Berry 0.10, CapacitorGroves Twisted 0.06) are still NOT placed: octree shrubs do not stamp into voxel chunks yet â€” see biome_vegetation.h.",
      "entries": [
        {
          "material": "lithokraft:procgen_formula_leaf",
          "min_height": 1,
          "max_height": 1,
          "density": 0.0,
          "biomes": {
            "dicing_plains": 0.012
          }
        },
        {
          "material": "lithokraft:procgen_formula_blob",
          "min_height": 1,
          "max_height": 1,
          "density": 0.0,
          "biomes": {
            "resonator_spires": 0.02
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "foliage_3d",
      "type": "groundcover",
      "comment": "Cortana 2026-10-15 2010: 3D voxel foliage INSTANCES (ids 82-86; one shared model per kind, lithokraft/content/foliage.h). Placed right after shrubs_dry_tuft (2026-10-15 2045), with the other ground cover and BEFORE the structures, so structures/stamps see it like any plant (scout never-overwrite test); its own name-derived seed stream. One roll per column (cheap). The game has no water yet, so cattails use capacitor_groves as the stand-in wetland biome.",
      "entries": [
